WEBVTT

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:16.082
OCTOBER SEVENTEENTH, NINETEEN NINETY SIX. THE SURVIVOR IS EVA EIZENBERG

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:20.874
E.V.A. E.I.Z.E.N.B.E.R.G.

00:00:20.874 --> 00:00:23.541
THE INTERVIEWER IS FAY NICOLL.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:25.453
THE LANGUAGE IS YIDDISH.

00:00:26.978 --> 00:00:28.322
TAPE FOUR.

00:00:29.644 --> 00:00:37.738
 di eltste, di eltere shvester hot getrogn di shteyner in SYNAGOGUE. dortn hot men nor getrogn di shteyner.

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:41.833
mikh mit mayn shvester LIZA

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.015
hot men geshikt tsu dem torf

00:00:45.085 --> 00:00:47.020
un s'iz

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:50.529
di el- antshuldikt, di elts- eltste shvester iz

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:52.440
POLLY, POLINA.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:54.360
vu iz zi geven biz yetst?

00:00:53.156 --> 00:00:58.526
zi hot gehat dos pitsele kind. zi iz geven mit undz di gantse tsayt. der man iz geshtorbn.

00:00:58.526 --> 00:01:01.481
dos kind iz geshtorbn, un zi iz geven mit undz.

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:02.898
tsuzamen.

00:01:05.081 --> 00:01:08.974
un zi iz geven geshikt in der SYNAGOGUE

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:14.829
un mikh mit mayn LIZA mit der shvester hot men geshikt tsu grobn dem torf

00:01:15.021 --> 00:01:16.314
in Tultshin.

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:20.331
azoy vi ikh bin geven

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:26.541
di yingste, ikh bin geven di klenste, m'hot mikh nisht gelozt oysvaksn.

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:34.134
bin ikh epes geven a shtik tsayt baym torf

00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:37.023
un dernokh hot men mikh geshikt

00:01:37.023 --> 00:01:41.728
in NESTERVARKA tsu dem tsigl, fabrik

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.753
ikh zol arbetn in kikh.

00:01:45.126 --> 00:01:46.911
iz in der fri flegn

00:01:46.911 --> 00:01:50.151
dos, dos hoypt plats iz geven

00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:51.515
in

00:01:51.589 --> 00:01:56.339
in kamers hot men undz tsunoyfgetribn vu s'iz geven

00:01:56.339 --> 00:01:59.269
vu s'iz geven a mol a KOLKHOZ bay zey dortn

00:01:59.269 --> 00:02:01.455
vu es zenen geven di, di, di

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:03.500
di hin- di

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.427
khazeyrim un di kien un di ferd.

00:02:06.427 --> 00:02:09.353
dortn hot men gemakht dray ⟨YAROSTNIY⟩ pritshn

00:02:10.101 --> 00:02:12.980
drayerley azoy ot o m- fun holts

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.120
un in eynem hot men undz arayngetribn

00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:19.831
dortn iz geven d- dos yugnt

00:02:19.922 --> 00:02:23.420
fleg men dortn azoy lign naket un borves

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:26.382
un, un in der fri fleg men mit

00:02:26.382 --> 00:02:30.221
gvald, mit shtekenes, mi- mit, mit, mit

00:02:30.221 --> 00:02:32.757
biksn fleg men shikn oyf der arbet

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:36.423
iz ey- eyn shvester iz geven in

00:02:36.423 --> 00:02:38.110
in SYNAGOGUE

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:41.364
un di LIZA iz geven baym torf

00:02:41.556 --> 00:02:48.350
un mikh fleg men gey- fleg men geyn tsu fus keyn NESTERVARKA. s'iz geven ergets nokh dem plats.

00:02:48.863 --> 00:02:51.877
dortn hot men mir geshikt in der kikh

00:02:53.605 --> 00:02:55.475
i in Tultshin

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.659
i dortn in NESTERVARKA

00:02:57.659 --> 00:03:00.399
hot men shoyn gegibn epes

00:03:00.878 --> 00:03:04.348
a CIORBA epes, epes a sup, epes vaser

00:03:04.894 --> 00:03:08.904
mit a shtikl m- mamelige eyn mol in tog

00:03:08.961 --> 00:03:11.435
azoyne kvadrate shtikelekh.

00:03:12.201 --> 00:03:16.802
mikh hot men geshikt in kikh, un az ikh bin geven dar un kleyn

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.905
iz, iz bin ikh tsvey mol arayngevor- -faln in dem tshan

00:03:20.905 --> 00:03:25.526
s'iz a tragikomedye, di yidishe ma- UNK se la- se lakht zikh un se veynt zikh

00:03:25.617 --> 00:03:29.239
bin ikh arayngefaln in dem tshan, un m'hot mikh koym fun dortn aroysgeshlept.

00:03:29.413 --> 00:03:32.512
ikh hob im gevashn iz, iz bin ikh arayngefaln.

00:03:33.261 --> 00:03:37.780
dort in dem NESTERVARKA zenen geven

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:42.438
yungvarg. bakhurim un, un, un froyen

00:03:42.438 --> 00:03:47.042
fun BOTOSANI un DOROHOI. dos iz rumenishe shtetlekh

00:03:47.453 --> 00:03:51.176
vos m'hot zey getribn oyf arbet, oyf, oyf torf.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:57.555
mit mir dortn iz geven a froy. zi hot oykh geheysn EVA

00:03:57.831 --> 00:03:59.760
a froy

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:00.815
mistam fun a

00:04:00.815 --> 00:04:02.814
finef, ⟨a⟩ zeks un tsvantsik yor

00:04:02.814 --> 00:04:05.789
iz zi fleg mikh nisht mer tsulozn tsu dem tshan.

00:04:05.897 --> 00:04:12.202
zi fleg zogn "ikh vel aleyn dos tun, vayl tomer vestu nokh a mol araynfaln, vet shoyn nisht zayn vemen aroystsushlepn."

00:04:13.727 --> 00:04:17.940
in der fri fleg men traybn oyf der arbet di bakhurim

00:04:18.267 --> 00:04:21.349
un bay nakht flegn zey kumen tsurik

00:04:21.387 --> 00:04:26.984
un, un lign oyf di, oyf di, oyf ⟨dem⟩ erd dortn, dortn in dem NESTERVARKA.

00:04:28.341 --> 00:04:32.182
in dem NESTERVARKA ho- iz gekumen a

00:04:32.323 --> 00:04:33.937
a inzhiner

00:04:34.129 --> 00:04:37.245
a rumenisher. er hot geheysn POPESCU.

00:04:38.112 --> 00:04:40.080
er iz gekumen mit der froy

00:04:40.103 --> 00:04:45.902
z- a, a sheyne froy a yefeyfie mit sheyne, royte hor

00:04:47.747 --> 00:04:50.559
ikh meyn az zenen geven nisht keyn shlekhte mentshn.

00:04:51.375 --> 00:04:53.613
es iz geven dortn yungvarg.

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:57.343
dos lebn fodert

00:04:57.602 --> 00:04:59.536
me zol lebn, me vil lebn.

00:04:59.627 --> 00:05:03.496
bay nakht, ven me fleg undz farshlisn mit, mit groyse shleser

00:05:03.496 --> 00:05:06.340
un di SANTINELAS flegn shteyn bay di tirn

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.416
fleg men zikh tsunoyfnemen

00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:11.846
un me fleg dertseyln mayses,

00:05:11.846 --> 00:05:15.846
tsunoyfshteln lider vos ikh ken zikh, gedenk zey zeyer fayn

00:05:15.895 --> 00:05:17.798
un me fleg zikh

00:05:17.798 --> 00:05:26.199
treystn eyns dos andere, un me fleg tomed trakhtn, se vet kumen a tsayt ven m'vet undz rateven, ven m'vet epes tun mit undz.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.950
vos hot ir getrakht vegn dem?

00:05:29.952 --> 00:05:34.485
u- un m'hot nor getrakht az me zol zikh rateven. m'hot azoy gevolt lebn.

00:05:35.554 --> 00:05:40.090
un m'hot azoy gevolt a frayheyt. m'hot azoy gevolt zayn fray

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:44.748
me zol nisht kukn az se shteyt di, di, di, di, di politsey mit di, mit di

00:05:44.748 --> 00:05:47.844
mitn gever az m'vet dikh nit shisn

00:05:47.844 --> 00:05:50.578
az du kenst oyfheybn di oygn. du kenst

00:05:50.578 --> 00:05:54.746
du kenst zayn a mentsh. m'vet nisht lakhn fun dir. m'vet aykh nisht

00:05:54.746 --> 00:05:57.696
shlogn. m'vet dikh nisht gvaldikn. m'vet nisht

00:05:57.696 --> 00:06:01.146
m'vet nisht tsugeyn di o- opraysn fun dir vos iz bay dir

00:06:01.146 --> 00:06:03.633
di shmate vos iz oyf dir, vos

00:06:03.633 --> 00:06:05.923
m'hot geshtrebt, zenen mir geven

00:06:05.923 --> 00:06:09.268
kinder, zekhtsn, zibetsn yor. m'hot gevolt lebn.

00:06:13.692 --> 00:06:16.436
ikh hob dos gantse lebn mayns gezungen un getantst.

00:06:17.252 --> 00:06:23.000
ikh hob gedenkt di rumenishe lider vos fun mayne shvester, fun mayne brider

00:06:23.428 --> 00:06:28.299
fleg men mir "Khavele, nu, heyb un tsu z- nu, zing, mayn kind, nu, tants, may-

00:06:28.558 --> 00:06:32.214
ikh gedenk, dos gedenk ikh, ikh hob zikh dermant di nakht.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.834
ikh hob gehat a

00:06:34.212 --> 00:06:35.592
a shoys

00:06:35.592 --> 00:06:37.580
fun, fun

00:06:38.953 --> 00:06:42.119
fun shmates gemakht vos mayn shvester hot gemakht

00:06:42.143 --> 00:06:44.536
iz hob ikh shtark gevolt tantsn

00:06:44.536 --> 00:06:48.016
un s- s'iz nisht geven, ikh hob nisht gekent tsenemen

00:06:48.016 --> 00:06:49.936
ho- hob ikh zi tsetrent

00:06:49.936 --> 00:06:51.569
un hob getantst.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:56.922
der, der inzhiner mit der froy

00:06:56.922 --> 00:07:00.800
hobn shtark lib gehat ven ikh fleg zingen di, di rumenishe lider

00:07:01.363 --> 00:07:04.664
flegn zey araynkumen a sakh mol un zikh tsuhern

00:07:04.806 --> 00:07:06.707
vi azoy me zingt.

00:07:06.983 --> 00:07:11.063
ikh gedenk, zey flegn a sakh mol durkhgeyn durkh mir

00:07:11.063 --> 00:07:12.945
un mikh knyapn in der bak

00:07:12.945 --> 00:07:14.789
un fleg mir zogn

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:21.354
oyf rumenish "O SARACA MEA, MEA FETITCANA" dos nebekhdike, dos kind.

00:07:23.402 --> 00:07:25.626
dos yugnt nemt zayns

00:07:25.626 --> 00:07:27.547
ikh hob gehat shvartse hor

00:07:27.621 --> 00:07:29.370
mit royte bek

00:07:29.798 --> 00:07:31.378
un

00:07:32.363 --> 00:07:33.724
un ikh hob gevolt lebn.

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:35.765
kh'hob azoy gevolt lebn.

00:07:36.092 --> 00:07:37.740
kh'fleg trakhtn bay nakht

00:07:38.286 --> 00:07:42.130
kholemen az ikh bin oyf der gas in Sekuran

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:44.155
az ikh, ikh loyf

00:07:44.155 --> 00:07:48.365
ikh loyf um, un ikh hob lib gehat royzn. biz haynt hob ikh lib

00:07:48.365 --> 00:07:50.935
ikh hob gevolt kukn oyfn himl

00:07:50.935 --> 00:07:52.925
m'hot mikh nisht gelozt kukn oyfn himl.

00:07:52.925 --> 00:07:54.515
s'iz geven ales farmakht.

00:07:54.515 --> 00:07:58.778
s'iz nisht geven keyn fentster. s'iz nisht geven keyn tirn

00:07:58.778 --> 00:08:03.629
iz zi, zey flegn mir a sakh mol, ⟨der⟩ POPESCU mit der froy

00:08:03.629 --> 00:08:06.714
flegn mir ibergibn epes

00:08:07.311 --> 00:08:09.341
e- esnvarg, epes

00:08:09.341 --> 00:08:12.651
e- epes. ikh gedenk, zi hot mir epes, epes a, a

00:08:12.651 --> 00:08:16.198
epes a por shmatkelekh, ikh zol nisht zayn azoy naket.

00:08:17.672 --> 00:08:18.796
oysgetun.

00:08:19.377 --> 00:08:23.267
nor zey flegn es nisht ⟨GLEICH⟩ mir gibn.

00:08:23.267 --> 00:08:26.937
zey flegn es ibergibn epes durkh andere mentshn, tsi zey hobn moyre gehat tsi

00:08:26.937 --> 00:08:28.516
ikh veys nisht.

00:08:32.472 --> 00:08:35.233
dort zenen mir geven

00:08:36.015 --> 00:08:39.367
s'iz shoyn geven vinter, dos dray un fertsikste yor.

00:08:40.318 --> 00:08:42.168
s'iz shoyn geven kalt

00:08:43.034 --> 00:08:46.010
derfar vayl ikh gedenk vi me fleg zikh

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:50.752
betn a- arayngeyn in der kikh vu s'iz geven der tshan vu me fleg makhn

00:08:50.752 --> 00:08:55.663
di, di CIORBA, fleg men zitsn zikh e- e- eyns mitn andern

00:08:55.663 --> 00:08:59.735
me zo- me, me fleg zikh varemen eyns dos andern.

00:09:01.868 --> 00:09:04.427
n- s'iz shoyn geven kalt.

00:09:04.517 --> 00:09:09.239
hot men undz ongehoybn tsu traybn, vider tsuge- tsugetribn tsu di

00:09:09.239 --> 00:09:13.087
vagonen di koytike fun di khayes

00:09:13.087 --> 00:09:16.003
un ho- m'hot undz oyfgezetst oyfn tsug

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.854
un m'hot undz geshlept.

00:09:19.367 --> 00:09:22.466
a sakh ts- epes, epes a sakh tsayt iz dos geven.

00:09:25.054 --> 00:09:26.296
vifl mentshn?

00:09:27.568 --> 00:09:32.169
s'iz geven mentshn. s'iz nisht keyn sakh, nor s'iz geven mentshn.

00:09:32.665 --> 00:09:35.859
me fleg, ikh gedenk

00:09:35.859 --> 00:09:38.809
vi ikh bin geshtanen, ikh ho- ikh hob nisht gehat keyn

00:09:38.809 --> 00:09:40.389
OXYGEN hob ikh nisht gehat

00:09:40.389 --> 00:09:42.529
iz fleg ikh zikh betn, ikh zol shteyn

00:09:42.529 --> 00:09:45.494
bay dir tir, bay di, di vagonen flegn zayn

00:09:45.494 --> 00:09:47.654
fest tsugemakht

00:09:47.683 --> 00:09:50.903
fleg ikh shteyn. ikh hob a sakh mol gezen vi

00:09:50.903 --> 00:09:53.663
fun andere vagonen varft men aroys mentshn

00:10:02.078 --> 00:10:06.662
vos zey zenen geshtorbn in di vagonen, umgekumen, fleg men zey aroysvarfn.

00:10:07.123 --> 00:10:08.647
zent ir ge-

00:10:07.478 --> 00:10:08.619
oyf di velder.

00:10:08.647 --> 00:10:10.959
zent ir geven mit beyde shvester

00:10:10.959 --> 00:10:12.140
in dem vagon?

00:10:12.166 --> 00:10:15.937
 neyn. ikh bin geven, di eltere shvester

00:10:15.937 --> 00:10:19.379
iz epes NACH, nokh derinen gekumen.

00:10:19.379 --> 00:10:22.237
ikh bin geven mit LIZA. zi hot mikh nisht opgelozt.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.310
bizn toyt hot zi mikh nisht opgelozt.

00:10:30.411 --> 00:10:32.565
ikh bin geven ir kind

00:10:32.858 --> 00:10:35.788
un ir mame un ir tate un ir gants lebn.

00:10:43.422 --> 00:10:47.736
zi hot mikh geratevet. ven nisht zi, volt ikh nisht gezesn itstert mit aykh.

00:10:53.395 --> 00:10:58.024
gebrakht hot men undz mit ot di, mit dem tsug mit ot di

00:10:58.024 --> 00:10:59.510
vagonen

00:11:00.162 --> 00:11:03.463
tsurik keyn MOGILEV, MOGILEV PODOLSK.

00:11:04.735 --> 00:11:08.385
dortn hot men undz tsunoyfgetribn in a

00:11:08.385 --> 00:11:11.395
s'iz shoyn geven vinter. s'iz shoy- s'hot shoyn geshneyt.

00:11:11.704 --> 00:11:15.076
dortn hot men undz arayngetribn

00:11:16.088 --> 00:11:17.486
in a

00:11:17.998 --> 00:11:21.299
a shul, vayzt oys iz dos geven.

00:11:21.745 --> 00:11:25.024
s'iz nisht geven keyn fentster. s'iz nisht geven keyn tirn. s'iz, iz

00:11:25.024 --> 00:11:29.200
s'iz nisht geven keyn vaser, s'iz nisht geven keyn ⟨LICHT⟩, s'iz nisht geven keyn tualetn.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.999
m'hot undz arayngetribn vi, vi di hint

00:11:32.072 --> 00:11:34.310
un m'hot undz avekgevorfn.

00:11:34.688 --> 00:11:37.500
dos iz geven MOGILEVER geto.

00:11:37.962 --> 00:11:42.664
dos iz geven oykh a CONCENTRATI- oykh di, di rumener mit di daytshn.

00:11:42.788 --> 00:11:44.435
es iz shoyn geven kalt.

00:11:49.268 --> 00:11:51.472
dort iz shoyn geven

00:11:51.495 --> 00:11:53.733
daytshn oykh zenen geven.

00:11:54.094 --> 00:11:56.433
s'iz shoyn geven a sakh natsi-

00:11:56.575 --> 00:12:00.129
zey, me fleg kumen bay nakht un shlepn

00:12:00.473 --> 00:12:01.851
yidishe meydlekh

00:12:02.397 --> 00:12:04.331
un hargenen un shlogn.

00:12:04.759 --> 00:12:10.743
tomer iz, tsufelik emetser hot zikh bavizn a kop tsi a fus tsi vos, hot men geshosn.

00:12:13.163 --> 00:12:18.540
epes in a m- in, in a monat tsayt, epes in a kleyn shtikl tsayt

00:12:18.563 --> 00:12:21.274
 ikh meyn az

00:12:21.432 --> 00:12:26.904
az di rumenishe yidn, tsi di amerikaner, m'hot zikh shoyn dervust. s'iz shoyn geven

00:12:26.904 --> 00:12:29.171
anfang fir un fertsik.

00:12:29.599 --> 00:12:33.660
es iz epes, hot men gezogt az me git epes esn

00:12:33.835 --> 00:12:37.949
in MIDDLE in shtot in, in MOGILEV PODOLSK

00:12:37.949 --> 00:12:40.342
hot men oyfgema- s'hot geheysn di kikh.

00:12:41.091 --> 00:12:44.477
fleg men traybn tsu der kikh

00:12:45.563 --> 00:12:47.767
shoenvayz fleg men traybn

00:12:48.212 --> 00:12:51.058
un a sakh hobn nisht derlebt tsutsukumen tsu der kikh

00:12:51.132 --> 00:12:53.708
un dortn fleg men shteyn in a raye

00:12:53.916 --> 00:12:57.639
shoenvayz fleg men shteyn, un me fleg epes gibn a bisl

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.727
vaser epes, epes esn

00:13:00.936 --> 00:13:04.324
un epes, zey flegn dakht zikh mir gibn epes

00:13:04.324 --> 00:13:05.750
ongetuekhts

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:07.125
flegn shteyn

00:13:07.105 --> 00:13:09.055
fun vemen iz dos geven?

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:11.353
dos, dos iz geven fun di

00:13:11.353 --> 00:13:13.080
fun di amerikaner yidn

00:13:13.221 --> 00:13:16.725
fun dem JOINT iz dos shoyn geven. dos iz shoyn geven JOINT.

00:13:18.452 --> 00:13:23.064
se geyen, azoy fil yorn geyen durkh, un az me trakht un redt

00:13:23.064 --> 00:13:27.165
iz, di velt hot shoyn gevust vayzt oys vos se kumt for.

00:13:27.165 --> 00:13:30.228
di velt hot shoyn gevust vos di ⟨natsien⟩ tuen.

00:13:30.228 --> 00:13:34.444
di velt hobn shoyn gevust fun di gazn. s'iz shoyn geven,

00:13:34.602 --> 00:13:38.024
nisht ende milkhome, nor s'iz shoyn gegangen tsu der ende.

00:13:38.024 --> 00:13:40.569
m'hot shoyn gevust fun TRANSNISTRIA.

00:13:40.626 --> 00:13:45.044
m'hot shoyn, s'iz geven eygene, s'iz geven mishpokhe, s'iz geven

00:13:45.044 --> 00:13:47.170
s'iz geven, un fun Rumenye.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:50.081
ANTONESCU hot zeyer lib gehat gelt

00:13:50.081 --> 00:13:54.291
dos mayn bruder vider fleg dernokh dem zogn az, az er iz gevorn a milyoner

00:13:54.291 --> 00:13:58.209
az dos vos m'hot gelozt shoyn gibn epes esn mit epes ongetuekhts

00:13:58.209 --> 00:14:04.675
iz geven vos di amerikaner, der JOINT hot gegibn gelt. m'hot ge- m'hot getsolt, m'hot geratevet. m'hot gevolt emetsn

00:14:04.675 --> 00:14:07.275
rateven dos ⟨di⟩ vos iz geblibn lebn.

00:14:10.933 --> 00:14:13.981
dort, in der kikh

00:14:14.089 --> 00:14:16.918
hobn mir bagegnt mayn eltstn bruder

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:18.744
LYOVA GROSS.

00:14:18.744 --> 00:14:23.553
mit ⟨opgefrirene⟩ fi- beyde fis ⟨opgefrir-⟩ opgefroyrene.

00:14:23.553 --> 00:14:24.563
I'M SORRY.

00:14:32.196 --> 00:14:34.603
er iz geven a held

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.746
sheyn

00:14:36.887 --> 00:14:38.467
gebildet

00:14:38.811 --> 00:14:39.947
hoykh.

00:14:39.947 --> 00:14:42.838
dos iz geven nisht keyn mentsh

00:14:43.688 --> 00:14:46.247
mit opgefroyrene fis.

00:14:46.658 --> 00:14:49.566
im hot men geshikt ergets in

00:14:49.566 --> 00:14:51.886
tsu, tsu

00:14:51.886 --> 00:14:54.380
hakn beymer in di velder.

00:14:54.842 --> 00:14:56.760
dort hobn mir zikh mit im bagegnt.

00:14:57.475 --> 00:14:59.848
dos iz geven der eyntsiker fun der mishpokhe

00:14:59.854 --> 00:15:01.710
vos mir hobn azoy bagegnt.

00:15:03.027 --> 00:15:05.880
biz demolst ho- hot ir nisht tsi er lebt

00:15:05.423 --> 00:15:09.816
OH, NO, NO. mir ho'mir, mir ho'mir gevust, m'ho-, fun

00:15:07.017 --> 00:15:08.617
er hot nisht gevust vegn aykh?

00:15:09.816 --> 00:15:11.309
Tshernovits

00:15:11.309 --> 00:15:12.850
hot men im geshikt

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:15.739
epes iz er gegangen

00:15:15.739 --> 00:15:17.494
khadoshimvayz

00:15:17.494 --> 00:15:19.895
iz er gegangen zukhn di mishpokhe

00:15:20.323 --> 00:15:22.865
un mir ho'mir zikh dervust

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.628
az s'iz do ergets mish- nor ver hot gekent aroysgeyn?

00:15:26.635 --> 00:15:29.770
epes, ikh, ikh gedenk dos nisht

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:32.073
nor mayn shvester hot gezogt az er iz

00:15:32.073 --> 00:15:34.678
er iz gekumen keyn Kopaygorod

00:15:34.802 --> 00:15:39.014
mit a s- s'hot im gebrakht epes tsvey soldatn

00:15:41.265 --> 00:15:43.405
un dernokh hot men im avekgenumen

00:15:43.405 --> 00:15:45.050
tsu grobn

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.763
er iz geven

00:15:46.763 --> 00:15:49.528
er iz arayn in gefangenheyt

00:15:49.534 --> 00:15:52.042
tsu di, tsu di rumener.

00:15:52.048 --> 00:15:55.197
er iz geven in der rusisher armey hot men im genumen

00:15:55.373 --> 00:16:00.041
un iz arayn tsu di, tsu di daytshn un tsu di rumener

00:16:00.267 --> 00:16:04.297
un m'hot UNK oykhet geshikt. er iz vayzt oys geven mit di, mit di buko-

00:16:04.297 --> 00:16:06.637
OH YES, er iz geven mit di bukoviner.

00:16:07.641 --> 00:16:11.856
un dernokh iz er gekumen tsun undz. dos hot mayn shvester dertseylt.

00:16:11.856 --> 00:16:14.345
un fun da- fun, fun Kopaygorod

00:16:14.345 --> 00:16:19.838
hot men im avekgenumen tsu hakn beymer ergets in di velder

00:16:19.838 --> 00:16:22.150
un ven mir ho'mir im zikh mit im bagegnt

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.399
iz er geven

00:16:23.399 --> 00:16:26.149
dos iz shoyn nisht geven a mentsh. dos iz shoyn geven a

00:16:26.149 --> 00:16:28.509
a halber mentsh, un

00:16:28.566 --> 00:16:32.576
er epes, er hot undz afile nisht gekukt oyf undz. er hot undz epes nisht derkent

00:16:32.717 --> 00:16:39.027
vayl er hot gezogt "gey, gey. ir d-" oykh dos zelbe, "ir zent yung. ir darft dokh lebn"

00:16:39.027 --> 00:16:42.052
un keyn fis iz b- geven opgefrir- -froyrene fis.

00:16:43.737 --> 00:16:48.084
dos iz geven fir un fertsik. dos iz shoyn geven

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:51.087
es iz shoyn geven vinter fir un fertsik.

00:16:52.765 --> 00:16:59.104
dos iz shoyn geven di, di UNK JOINT hot shoyn epes gegibn m- epes hot men undz ongetun

00:16:59.262 --> 00:17:05.078
un me fleg ⟨oykh⟩ gibn epes eyn mol in tog di, d- epes a bisl su- CIORBA, sup, ikh veys nisht vos.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:12.097
in april fir un fertsik hot undz bafrayt di rusishe armey.

00:17:12.154 --> 00:17:13.987
di, di royte armey.

00:17:14.601 --> 00:17:16.569
vos gedenkt ir vegn dem tog?

00:17:16.828 --> 00:17:18.408
 oh

00:17:19.039 --> 00:17:24.720
koydem kol ⟨gedenken⟩ mir vi di daytshn, es iz geven oyfgerisn ale brikn

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:28.044
fun MOGILEV PODOLSK

00:17:28.067 --> 00:17:31.385
keyn Ataki keyn, tsu der Dnyester.

00:17:32.679 --> 00:17:34.761
mir hobn moyre gehat aroystsugeyn.

00:17:35.037 --> 00:17:37.714
m'hot geshosn fun ale zaytn

00:17:38.277 --> 00:17:42.357
un m- s'hot zikh ge- m- gekumen tsun undz a por

00:17:42.357 --> 00:17:43.918
partizanen

00:17:43.918 --> 00:17:46.506
un m'hot oyfgemakht di tir, un m'hot gezogt

00:17:46.579 --> 00:17:48.159
"ir zent bafrayt."

00:17:48.823 --> 00:17:52.001
hot men gemeynt az s'iz ibergetunene natsis

00:17:52.001 --> 00:17:55.232
un m'hot moyre gehat, un keyner hot zikh nisht gerirt funem plats.

00:17:55.232 --> 00:17:58.402
m'iz geblibn in der, in der shul in der tsebrokhener.

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:02.852
nor s'iz geven ofn di fentster, un a sakh mentshn zenen aroysgegangen

00:18:02.852 --> 00:18:07.245
un m'hot shoyn gevust az s'iz a bafrayung. m'hot gevust az di rusn zenen gekumen.

00:18:08.112 --> 00:18:12.622
mayn shvester hot nisht gelozt mikh in ergets nisht geyn. UNK ⟨zi⟩ hot mikh arumgenumen

00:18:12.622 --> 00:18:17.081
un hot gezogt az do veln mir shteyn. az m'vet undz bafrayen, vey men kumen aher undz bafrayen.

00:18:17.123 --> 00:18:21.212
demlt hot zi mir gezogt in oyer arayn "ot itstert veln mir aheymforn.

00:18:21.212 --> 00:18:22.975
veln mir forn keyn Sekuren.

00:18:22.975 --> 00:18:25.487
du zest? ikh hob dir gezogt, zay shtil."

00:18:25.847 --> 00:18:28.895
un ikh hob zikh gerisn. ikh hob gevolt geyn. zi hot mikh nisht gelozt.

00:18:29.374 --> 00:18:32.744
dos eyntsike vos iz epes in a por teg arum

00:18:32.744 --> 00:18:35.894
zenen mir geshtanen in droysn lebn der, oyf der gas

00:18:35.894 --> 00:18:38.444
zenen gelofn daytshishe

00:18:38.444 --> 00:18:40.254
iber- fleg men zikh ibertun

00:18:40.254 --> 00:18:42.504
un avekgevorfn di ale gever

00:18:42.504 --> 00:18:46.006
mit alemen, un epes a por hobn zikh gebahaltn bay undz in der, in dem

00:18:46.006 --> 00:18:47.258
in dem hoyz

00:18:47.258 --> 00:18:49.612
un m'hot geshrign

00:18:49.612 --> 00:18:53.253
"WIR zenen NICHT NAZIEN. WIR zenen NICHT BITE

00:18:53.253 --> 00:18:55.703
HELFEN SIE, HELFEN SIE UNS UNK"

00:18:56.733 --> 00:18:58.495
ver vos, UNK

00:19:01.099 --> 00:19:04.113
b- a vokh tsayt iz bikhlal keyner nisht geven.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:07.877
m'hot zikh gevalgert oyf di gasn

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:13.985
un yeder hot gemeynt az, ⟨az⟩ bald kumt men. me nemt undz bay der hant, un m'vet undz avekfirn.

00:19:14.397 --> 00:19:18.863
keyner iz nisht gekumen, un keyner hot undz nisht genumen, un keyner hot undz nisht gedarft hobn.

00:19:18.953 --> 00:19:22.323
di rusn hobn undz nisht gedarft hobn, un di antisemitn

00:19:19.088 --> 00:19:20.520
vos hot ir getun?

00:19:22.323 --> 00:19:26.013
di goyim, di, di, di ukrayner hobn tsu di

00:19:26.013 --> 00:19:27.686
nokh mer nisht gedarft hobn.

00:19:27.694 --> 00:19:29.954
vos hot ir getun in di vokh?

00:19:30.799 --> 00:19:32.525
ven s'iz nisht geven

00:19:32.525 --> 00:19:37.476
m'iz umgegangen. m'hot moyre gehat, ⟨un⟩ me fleg aroysgeyn. me fleg umgeyn zukhn esn

00:19:37.752 --> 00:19:43.013
mit di vos zenen antlofn, di, di ukrayner vos zenen antlofn mit di daytshn

00:19:43.013 --> 00:19:45.450
un m'hot gefirt, e-

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:47.823
di zakhn vos m'hot ongerabevet bay di yidn

00:19:47.823 --> 00:19:49.743
hot men gefirt. es iz geforn

00:19:49.743 --> 00:19:52.943
mashinen mit vegn mit ferd mit

00:19:52.943 --> 00:19:56.560
mit, mit alemen. m'iz antlofn, un s'iz zeyer a sakh ukrayner

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:59.911
antlofn mit di, mit di daytshn vos zey hobn geshlept mitn farmegn.

00:20:00.465 --> 00:20:03.385
in shtot zenen, iz umgeforn

00:20:03.385 --> 00:20:07.165
say in Kopaygorod un say in MOGILEV un say in Tultshin

00:20:07.165 --> 00:20:10.038
fleg kursirn a vogn mit eyn ferd

00:20:10.038 --> 00:20:13.211
un me fleg tsunoyfnemen di toyte mentshn di skeletn

00:20:13.211 --> 00:20:16.004
un keyner veys nisht biz haynt vu di beyner zenen.

00:20:16.004 --> 00:20:18.510
ikh veys nisht vu es zenen di beyner fun ⟨mayne ale⟩

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:19.528
biz haynt.

00:20:23.179 --> 00:20:28.235
mir ze'mir geze- ikh mit mayn shvester zenen mir gezesn in MOGILEV

00:20:29.355 --> 00:20:31.694
hungerik, shleferik

00:20:32.005 --> 00:20:32.994
koytik

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.542
naket

00:20:37.624 --> 00:20:39.103
un mir ho'mir gezungen

00:20:40.594 --> 00:20:44.675
in dem geto in, in NESTERVARKA

00:20:44.675 --> 00:20:48.098
iz dos yugnt, hobn mir gesha- hobn mir aleyn gemakht lider.

00:20:50.128 --> 00:20:52.282
tsunoyfgeshtelt yidishe lider

00:20:54.297 --> 00:20:57.548
vos kinder hobn zey aleyn gemakht.

00:20:59.967 --> 00:21:05.799
zenen mir gezesn oyf der gas, es iz shmutsike, dos shmuts, kh'ken zikh nisht fargesn dos shmuts.

00:21:06.396 --> 00:21:07.807
un mir ho'mir gezungen.

00:21:09.298 --> 00:21:14.202
plutsem iz tsun undz tsugekumen a, a, a r- a rusisher ofitser

00:21:14.293 --> 00:21:16.256
ongetun in in

00:21:16.256 --> 00:21:19.349
in rusishe ongetuekhts

00:21:19.609 --> 00:21:22.353
un hot ongehoybn mit, tsun undz tsu redn yidish.

00:21:24.621 --> 00:21:29.089
dos iz geven IOSIF ZELMANOVICH

00:21:29.089 --> 00:21:30.335
FEL'DMAN

00:21:32.535 --> 00:21:34.351
a yid fun Poyln

00:21:35.691 --> 00:21:37.052
a fidler

00:21:37.834 --> 00:21:41.231
vos hot dos ershte mol in

00:21:41.231 --> 00:21:42.570
in MOGILEV

00:21:43.048 --> 00:21:45.641
zikh dervust vos se kumt for mit di yidn.

00:21:46.288 --> 00:21:48.307
er z- bikhlal nisht gevust.

00:21:48.465 --> 00:21:50.568
er iz geven STUPID

00:21:53.275 --> 00:21:58.365
un hot gezogt az er iz a ofitsir in der ru- rusisher armey

00:21:59.417 --> 00:22:03.967
un er vil undz nemen mit zikh un undz gibn esn

00:22:04.615 --> 00:22:07.697
un mir zoln dertseyln vos iz mit undz forgekumen.

00:22:10.774 --> 00:22:13.724
un mir ho'mir im dertseylt, un mir ho'mir geveynt

00:22:13.724 --> 00:22:15.442
un er hot oykh geveynt.

00:22:16.258 --> 00:22:22.327
er iz geven, er iz geven azoy iberrasht az mir ho'mir far im moyre gehat az er zol nisht meshuge vern.

00:22:23.160 --> 00:22:26.450
vu iz er geven vos er hot nisht gevust fun gornisht?

00:22:25.202 --> 00:22:28.363
er iz geven, zey z- dos iz geven

00:22:28.363 --> 00:22:30.328
a rusishe polk

00:22:30.328 --> 00:22:33.417
dos iz geven, ikh muz es zogn oyf rusish, ikh ken nisht

00:22:33.417 --> 00:22:34.646
dos iz geven

00:22:35.158 --> 00:22:39.129
TRETIY ⟨FUOS⟩. dos iz geven a

00:22:39.129 --> 00:22:40.400
a mh

00:22:41.976 --> 00:22:43.989
fun a militer

00:22:43.989 --> 00:22:46.521
inzhiner polk

00:22:46.521 --> 00:22:49.094
vos zey hobn gesh- ge- geboyt

00:22:49.094 --> 00:22:51.049
pontone brikn.

00:22:51.325 --> 00:22:57.388
vos zey zenen gegangen fun Sibir, zenen zey gegangen nokh der armey. dos iz geven

00:22:57.388 --> 00:23:00.638
zelner, ⟨dos zenen⟩ geven armey

00:23:00.638 --> 00:23:02.288
vos az zey ge- flegn geyn

00:23:02.288 --> 00:23:04.358
nokh draysik fertsik kilometer

00:23:04.358 --> 00:23:05.829
NACH dem front

00:23:05.829 --> 00:23:07.670
un zey flegn makhn brikn

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:11.298
kedey di armey zol kenen geyn vayter un vayter.

00:23:12.233 --> 00:23:17.390
der yid I- IOSIF ZELMANOVICH FEL'DMAN

00:23:17.498 --> 00:23:21.080
ikh meyn az dos iz geven a sheliekh fun got.

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:26.114
er hot undz geratevet fun hunger un fun, fun alemen

00:23:27.606 --> 00:23:33.213
vayl di eltste shvester undzere iz geblibn, un dernokh fun MOGILEV iz zi gegangen tsu fus

00:23:33.213 --> 00:23:34.721
keyn Sekuren.

00:23:35.132 --> 00:23:39.075
un zi hot zikh gut, ersht demlt hot zi zikh gut ongemutshet bay di rusn.

00:23:39.182 --> 00:23:43.566
biz m'hot, zey zenen gegangen tsu fus un hungerik un shleferik, un m'hot zey ge-

00:23:43.566 --> 00:23:46.263
geshlogn, vayl bay, STALIN ⟨hot⟩ gezogt az

00:23:46.287 --> 00:23:49.591
di mentshn vos zenen geblibn bay di daytshn

00:23:49.591 --> 00:23:51.601
un di, di s- di, di

00:23:51.601 --> 00:23:54.341
di plenen, d- d- vos zenen arayn in plen

00:23:54.341 --> 00:23:58.724
hobn gedarft zelbstmord ⟨bakumen⟩, vos zey zenen geven, zey hobn gedarft zayn patryotn

00:23:58.724 --> 00:24:02.784
vos heyst m'iz gegangen, un m'iz geblibn bay di r- bay di daytshn un bay di rumener

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:09.444
e- der yid, der ofitsir, hot undz genumen mit zikh tsu zayn

00:24:09.444 --> 00:24:11.052
komandir

00:24:11.835 --> 00:24:17.460
un hot undz gebrakht. dem gantsn veg iz er gegangen, un iz, un hot zikh gerisn mayn UNK dem kop

00:24:17.460 --> 00:24:19.122
er hot nisht gekent farshteyn

00:24:19.122 --> 00:24:22.522
vi, vi azoy v- m'hot nisht gevust gornisht.

00:24:22.522 --> 00:24:25.422
m'hot nisht dertseylt. m'hot nisht geredt fun azoyne zakhn

00:24:25.422 --> 00:24:28.386
iz ⟨dos⟩ geven dos ershte plats, ikh zog es nokh a mol

00:24:28.386 --> 00:24:32.166
vu er hot zikh dervust fun di yidishe lagers

00:24:32.166 --> 00:24:34.647
fun di getos, fun di CONCENTRATION

00:24:34.647 --> 00:24:37.221
fun di, fun di, fun

00:24:37.221 --> 00:24:40.972
di, di, di, vi m'hot geharget un gebrent di mentshn

00:24:40.978 --> 00:24:44.448
un er hot geredt mit undz yidish. poylish, yidish.

00:24:45.062 --> 00:24:48.805
er hot undz gebrakht tsu dem kolonel, tsu dem komandir

00:24:48.805 --> 00:24:52.138
der NAHME fun dem komandir iz

00:24:52.138 --> 00:24:55.687
leytna- n- kolonel ROGOZIN.

00:24:55.947 --> 00:24:58.033
zayn froy iz geven a yidishke.

00:24:59.338 --> 00:25:01.728
koydem kol hot er undz gegibn esn

00:25:02.427 --> 00:25:05.762
nor zey hobn moyre gehat az mir zoln mir esn a sakh

00:25:06.021 --> 00:25:11.567
un zey hobn gevolt tsunemen bay undz dos shtikl broyt mit dem esn vos zey hobn gegibn

00:25:11.691 --> 00:25:13.791
hot er undz gegibn tsu farshteyn

00:25:13.791 --> 00:25:15.871
az me, az m'vet dos undz a- UNK

00:25:15.871 --> 00:25:17.371
gibn mit undz

00:25:17.371 --> 00:25:19.833
nor me tor nisht teykef esn a sakh broyt

00:25:19.926 --> 00:25:22.029
vayl mir kenen geshvoln vern.

00:25:23.453 --> 00:25:26.501
er hot undz tsugefirt tsu dem komandir

00:25:26.862 --> 00:25:30.602
un un geveynt un, un

00:25:30.726 --> 00:25:33.487
un hot im dertseylt ver mir zenen

00:25:33.612 --> 00:25:36.131
un az mir zingen mir zeyer sheyn

00:25:36.131 --> 00:25:39.781
un vos mir ho'mir, in kurtsn vos mir ho'mir mitgemakht

00:25:39.940 --> 00:25:43.714
un az er hot undz gefunen oyf der gas un az mir zingen mir zeyer sheyn.

00:25:44.563 --> 00:25:47.758
 s'hot zikh

00:25:47.758 --> 00:25:50.129
s- s'hot zikh ge- er hot undz dertseylt

00:25:50.129 --> 00:25:53.090
az er zukht tsu makhn a ansambl

00:25:53.090 --> 00:25:55.053
un er zukht talantn

00:25:55.768 --> 00:25:57.866
un oyb mir viln mir

00:25:57.866 --> 00:26:03.069
iz kenen mir blaybn bay zey arbetn, farshidene arbet vos m'vet undz forleygn

00:26:03.092 --> 00:26:05.971
un az mir darfn, zoln mir zingen un tantsn.

00:26:07.260 --> 00:26:12.809
m'hot undz ongetun in zeyer, in, ir zolt mir moykhl zayn, in gatyes un in groyse hemder

00:26:12.809 --> 00:26:14.226
un FUFAYKAS

00:26:14.226 --> 00:26:17.682
vayl zey hob nisht gehat keyn, vegn froyen keyn ongetuekhts

00:26:17.790 --> 00:26:21.159
un, un m'hot undz gegibn esn mit zikh

00:26:21.165 --> 00:26:24.883
un m'hot gezogt az m'vet kumen morgn oyfn tsveytn tog

00:26:24.883 --> 00:26:27.870
mir zoln mir zikh, tsi mir viln mir kumen

00:26:27.870 --> 00:26:29.608
vet men undz kumen nemen

00:26:29.608 --> 00:26:33.700
un er hot gezogt az s'vet aykh zayn gut, m'vet aykh nit shlogn mer

00:26:33.700 --> 00:26:37.700
ir zolt nisht moyre hobn, m'vet aykh nit shlogn, m'vet aykh nisht hargenen

00:26:37.700 --> 00:26:39.792
ir vet kenen esn

00:26:39.792 --> 00:26:44.483
un ir vet zayn fraye, un ir vet kenen ⟨helfn⟩, ir vet bakumen

00:26:44.483 --> 00:26:46.727
gelt far der arbet

00:26:46.727 --> 00:26:49.340
un ir vet kenen helfn der shvester

00:26:49.363 --> 00:26:51.939
di drite vos, POLYA.

00:26:54.882 --> 00:26:58.909
dos iz geven undzer emes bafrayung.

00:27:00.282 --> 00:27:01.845
er hot undz geratevet.

00:27:03.015 --> 00:27:04.781
mit der armey

00:27:04.888 --> 00:27:11.260
zenen mir gegangen vayter mit zey. dos iz geven dos fir un fertsikste yor.

00:27:12.077 --> 00:27:16.830
m'vet ze- m'iz yung. es hot zikh gevolt zingen. s'hot zikh gevolt lebn.

00:27:17.038 --> 00:27:20.680
mir hobn ongehoybn tsu arbetn dortn oyf farshidene arbetn.

00:27:20.680 --> 00:27:23.225
ikh hob gearbet in biblyotek.

00:27:23.569 --> 00:27:28.423
mayn shvester iz geven, fleg shraybn un iber-

00:27:28.463 --> 00:27:30.873
⟨oyf, fun⟩ rumenish oyf rusish, un fun

00:27:30.873 --> 00:27:32.929
rusish oyf daytsh

00:27:33.002 --> 00:27:35.834
vu me fleg shikn, ⟨fleg men⟩ geyn arbetn.

00:27:35.834 --> 00:27:39.327
m- s'iz geven di eroplanen hot men gedarft vashn

00:27:39.327 --> 00:27:42.204
ales vos m'hot geshikt iz ⟨men⟩ gegangen

00:27:42.204 --> 00:27:46.715
un me fleg, fleg makhn kontsertn, fleg zingen un tantsn.

00:27:47.434 --> 00:27:49.720
far vemen hot ir gemakht di kontsertn?

00:27:49.350 --> 00:27:50.996
far der armey.

00:27:50.996 --> 00:27:52.672
far der rusisher armey.

00:27:53.235 --> 00:27:58.038
un NACH dem ven zenen mir shoyn ongekumen, mit zey zenen mir ibergegangen

00:27:58.129 --> 00:27:59.658
Rumenye

00:28:00.238 --> 00:28:02.442
Ungarn

00:28:02.989 --> 00:28:04.986
CZECHOSLOVAKIA

00:28:04.986 --> 00:28:06.341
Estraykh

00:28:06.364 --> 00:28:10.644
un zenen mir arayngeforn dakht zikh az mir ze'mir geven in Daytshland

00:28:10.920 --> 00:28:12.770
nor nisht keyn sakh tsayt.

00:28:13.063 --> 00:28:16.755
tsurik hot men undz geshikt keyn Estraykh, keyn Vin.

00:28:16.755 --> 00:28:18.924
dortn iz gevorn di baze.

00:28:18.924 --> 00:28:24.300
dos iz geven fir un fe- toyznt nayn hundert fir un fertsik.
